are rendered as a compact cell listing for notebook_edit — pass raw:true for underlying JSON.\",\"name\":\"read_file\",\"parameters\":{\"properties\":{\"column\":{\"description\":\"1-based character position within the first rendered line. Use the column from nextRead to continue an oversized single line without repeating its beginning.\",\"minimum\":1,\"type\":\"integer\"},\"hashed\":{\"description\":\"Prefix each line with a 6-char content hash for edit_file_hashed anchoring\",\"type\":\"boolean\"},\"limit\":{\"description\":\"Maximum number of lines to return starting at offset (omit to read to end, subject to the size cap).\",\"type\":\"integer\"},\"offset\":{\"description\":\"1-based line number to start reading from (omit to read from the top). Use with limit to page a large file.\",\"type\":\"integer\"},\"path\":{\"description\":\"File path to read\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"raw\":{\"description\":\"For .ipynb: return the raw notebook JSON instead of the rendered cell listing\",\"type\":\"boolean\"}},\"required\":[\"path\"],\"type\":\"object\"}},\"type\":\"function\"}","digest":"sha256:e6ce4163538c84562418274066404c894d6eb6fb6e73ac60c06b49e92a178f64"},{"schemaVersion":1,"itemId":"cli-tool-5bf05cf51ac27f26a28d6a3786cb206f","kind":"tool-schema","scope":"session","scopeId":"headless-1791693178592-25","sourceRef":{"store":"cli-tool-registry","id":"write_file","digest":"sha256:5bf05cf51ac27f26a28d6a3786cb206f1ddce7a29de49e48a6948172e0521a96"},"provenance":{"source":"cli-tool-registry","observedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z"},"trust":"host","sensitivity":"internal","allowedSinks":["provider.volcengine"],"tokenEstimate":75,"priority":599999,"pinned":false,"createdAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","content":"{\"function\":{\"description\":\"Write content to a file (create or overwrite)\",\"name\":\"write_file\",\"parameters\":{\"properties\":{\"content\":{\"description\":\"File content\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"path\":{\"description\":\"File path\",\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"path\",\"content\"],\"type\":\"object\"}},\"type\":\"function\"}","digest":"sha256:7fb932f96b1a685fda482c75dd9ebd422a1a350b17bdb610581f11c8a0171209"},{"schemaVersion":1,"itemId":"cli-tool-d196c2ec4cf80fcfdcf2dd9bd5dc3c31","kind":"tool-schema","scope":"session","scopeId":"headless-1791693178592-25","sourceRef":{"store":"cli-tool-registry","id":"edit_file","digest":"sha256:d196c2ec4cf80fcfdcf2dd9bd5dc3c31aee119bda189829f0f249386ee59557e"},"provenance":{"source":"cli-tool-registry","observedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z"},"trust":"host","sensitivity":"internal","allowedSinks":["provider.volcengine"],"tokenEstimate":188,"priority":599998,"pinned":false,"createdAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","content":"{\"function\":{\"description\":\"Replace a string in a file. old_string must match EXACTLY ONE place — include enough surrounding context to make it unique, or the edit is rejected. Pass replace_all:true to change every occurrence instead.\",\"name\":\"edit_file\",\"parameters\":{\"properties\":{\"new_string\":{\"description\":\"Replacement string\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"old_string\":{\"description\":\"Exact string to replace; must be unique in the file unless replace_all is true\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"path\":{\"description\":\"File path\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"replace_all\":{\"description\":\"Replace every occurrence of old_string instead of requiring a unique match (default false)\",\"type\":\"boolean\"}},\"required\":[\"path\",\"old_string\",\"new_string\"],\"type\":\"object\"}},\"type\":\"function\"}","digest":"sha256:d2c179753f2d32c63e6ef3b99c072950cd409b3b99e274355361f8a7a538c109"},{"schemaVersion":1,"itemId":"cli-tool-6b92c33b744253be4c9016cfe7da792b","kind":"tool-schema","scope":"session","scopeId":"headless-1791693178592-25","sourceRef":{"store":"cli-tool-registry","id":"edit_file_hashed","digest":"sha256:6b92c33b744253be4c9016cfe7da792b27d22e605485ac9b1d658083bc6a70e2"},"provenance":{"source":"cli-tool-registry","observedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z"},"trust":"host","sensitivity":"internal","allowedSinks":["provider.volcengine"],"tokenEstimate":269,"priority":599997,"pinned":false,"createdAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","content":"{\"function\":{\"description\":\"Replace a single line in a file, anchored by its content hash. Use this instead of edit_file for robust edits: each line of read_file output (with hashed:true) is tagged with a 6-char hash like 'a3Kp9Z| const x = ...'. Pass the hash as anchor_hash, the current line as expected_line, and the replacement as new_line. Rejects edits if the line drifted (hash mismatch) — retry by re-reading the file with hashed:true.\",\"name\":\"edit_file_hashed\",\"parameters\":{\"properties\":{\"anchor_hash\":{\"description\":\"6-char base64url hash of the line to replace (from read_file with hashed:true)\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"expected_line\":{\"description\":\"Current content of the line — used as a second-layer check against hash collisions. Compared after .trim().\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"new_line\":{\"description\":\"Replacement line content (without the hash tag prefix). Preserve the original indentation.\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"path\":{\"description\":\"File path\",\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"path\",\"anchor_hash\",\"expected_line\",\"new_line\"],\"type\":\"object\"}},\"type\":\"function\"}","digest":"sha256:aaee310fc143c4974cfb0e71a2e0bf04a3f4fc43dad5b18758eb55d11833d20b"},{"schemaVersion":1,"itemId":"cli-tool-757401606a35f787c889387c88f27cba","kind":"tool-schema","scope":"session","scopeId":"headless-1791693178592-25","sourceRef":{"store":"cli-tool-registry","id":"search_files","digest":"sha256:757401606a35f787c889387c88f27cba60f116afb9e6b906a216d7d274989a56"},"provenance":{"source":"cli-tool-registry","observedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z"},"trust":"host","sensitivity":"internal","allowedSinks":["provider.volcengine"],"tokenEstimate":402,"priority":599996,"pinned":false,"createdAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","content":"{\"function\":{\"description\":\"Search for files by name pattern or content. For a long text file, pass path and pattern: returns matching line/column positions, nearby context, and nextRead arguments for read_file. This streams the file instead of loading it into model context. Continue capped results with nextOffset as offset. Omit path for the existing directory search.\",\"name\":\"search_files\",\"parameters\":{\"properties\":{\"caseSensitive\":{\"description\":\"Single-file search only: match case (default false).\",\"type\":\"boolean\"},\"content_search\":{\"description\":\"If true, search file contents instead of names\",\"type\":\"boolean\"},\"contextChars\":{\"description\":\"Single-file search: characters around each match (default 150).\",\"maximum\":1000,\"minimum\":0,\"type\":\"integer\"},\"directory\":{\"description\":\"Directory to search in (default: cwd)\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"maxMatches\":{\"description\":\"Single-file search: maximum matching excerpts (default 20).\",\"maximum\":100,\"minimum\":1,\"type\":\"integer\"},\"offset\":{\"description\":\"Single-file search: zero-based character offset to continue from nextOffset (default 0).\",\"minimum\":0,\"type\":\"integer\"},\"path\":{\"description\":\"One text file to search by literal keyword (takes precedence over directory/content_search).\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"pattern\":{\"description\":\"Glob pattern or search string\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"regex\":{\"description\":\"Single-file search only: evaluate a regular expression in overlapping 64K text windows (default false). Prefer literals for exact coverage across window boundaries.\",\"type\":\"boolean\"}},\"required\":[\"pattern\"],\"type\":\"object\"}},\"type\":\"function\"}","digest":"sha256:5833453d6ae00a0a16046a1635726c77fc52ef7b9b816b6d6fde868e97f41db9"},{"schemaVersion":1,"itemId":"cli-tool-be3979c14f6ea9985a267e3673603eec","kind":"tool-schema","scope":"session","scopeId":"headless-1791693178592-25","sourceRef":{"store":"cli-tool-registry","id":"list_dir"